From donahue@ulexite.nist.gov Mon Jun  2 18:35:27 1997
Message-ID: <199706022226.SAA11417@ulexite.nist.gov>
Date: Mon, 2 Jun 1997 18:26:36 -0400
From: Michael J. Donahue <donahue@ulexite.nist.gov>
Subject: Re: 500 MHz 21164 vs P166 ?!

On Mon, 2 Jun 1997, Lee Burnside wrote:

>On Mon, 2 Jun 1997, Alex Krowitz wrote:
>
>> 
>> Has there been any resolution to this issue? I'm thinking of buying a
>> 500 MHz 21164 to run neural network simulations, and I need something
