Dear Rick,

this is really not an issue for the axp list, but a general unix question.
Anyway, say you are sitting a terminal A, and have connected to terminal
B. On terminal B write (in bash) export DISPLAY=B:0. Then you have to
allow terminal B to connect to A, which you do (on A) by: xhost B
That's all.

