make[1]: *** [sub_dirs] Error 2
make[1]: Leaving directory `/usr/src/linux-2.0.30/drivers'
make: *** [linuxsubdirs] Error 2

Any ideas what would cause the SIGABRT? Any ideas on how to fix the problem?

This is slightly mission critical, as in it should have been done last 
