From rick@mercury.flipag.net Mon Jun 16 12:22:50 1997
Message-ID: <199706161735.NAA06699@crim12b.nsls.bnl.gov>
Date: Mon, 16 Jun 1997 11:23:14 -0500 (CDT)
From: Rick Windham <rick@mercury.flipag.net>
Subject: Re: Problems building 2.1.42 kernel
In-Reply-To: <199706161735.NAA06699@crim12b.nsls.bnl.gov>

On Mon, 16 Jun 1997, m. capel wrote:

> what am i doing wrong???  i've had no problems in building the 2.0 kernels.

In /usr/src/linux/Makefile make sure SMP=1 is commented out.  Plus you'll
need a newer binutils to make modules work correctly.  You need:
binutils-970127-1.

-Rick

