Can't do it yet... currently, wine *has* to run on an x86 CPU.
Wine depends on the cpu to run the code; it just emulates the
Windows API calls.

An interesting experiment would be to take the em86 execution
engine and bolt it onto Wine, but I don't have the cycles to do
that.  Anyone who does is free to contact me regarding use of
the engine 8-)

